          "text": "Implemented `kth_smallest_amount` in `/workspace/src/component.py` using inclusion-exclusion to count distinct multiples and binary search to find the k-th amount. Redundant denominations are removed to reduce the computation.\n\nThe examples, doctests, and random brute-force checks pass. **Publication is blocked by one inconsistent project test:** for `[21, 5, 18, 17, 8, 11, 19, 25, 13, 10, 24, 23, 15]` and `k = 1218177966`, the specified distinct-amount ranking gives `2242115680`; the test expects `2242115681`, which is the next valid amount. The publisher rejected the release on that assertion, so no release is currently published.",
